[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800900_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800900_01_0010","text":"今天的阳光好强啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800900_01_0020","text":"雾子，我帮你买了水\n要不要补充一下水分？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800900_01_0030","text":"好的……\n谢谢你……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800900_01_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800900_01_0040","text":"…………\n……呵呵……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800900_01_0050","text":"感觉……\n稍微凉快了一些……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800900_01_0060","text":"啊……\n天空……暗下来了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800900_01_0070","text":"呵呵……\n又稍微……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800900_01_0080","text":"哈哈，变凉快了呢\n多亏了云"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800900_01_0090","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800900_01_0100","text":"是不是在看着我们呢……\n在看着我们的事……"}]
